Package: imx415-60fps-dkms
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Miloslav Mrvík <miloslav.mrvik@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/bambooCZ/rk3588-imx415-4k60
Depends: dkms, dwarves, device-tree-compiler, initramfs-tools, linux-image-vendor-rk35xx (<< 26.11), linux-headers-vendor-rk35xx (<< 26.11), linux-dtb-vendor-rk35xx (<< 26.11)
Description: IMX415 (Radxa Camera 4K) at 4K@60 for the RK3588 vendor kernel (DKMS)
 The Rockchip vendor imx415 driver with a 4-lane linear 3864x2192 60 fps mode,
 built by DKMS as the out-of-tree module imx415_60fps for every installed
 Armbian vendor-rk35xx kernel, plus the Radxa Camera 4K overlay rebound to it
 (/boot/overlay-user/rock-5b-radxa-camera-4k-60fps.dtbo) and the module added
 to the initramfs.
 .
 For the vendor kernels before Armbian 26.11 (before rk-6.1-rkr7.2). The boot
 configuration (user_overlays, extraargs) is left to you: see the README.
